  "title": "Linda&#39;s Monster Cookies",
  "description": "Linda&#39;s monster cookies are chewy and good. This recipe uses white and brown sugar, vanilla, oats, semisweet chocolate chips, and candy-coated chocolate.",
  "authors": [
    "SYNEVA B"
  ],
